  - name: Tutorial
    portrait: {fileID: -583743315, guid: 9eb1f13c449026d43b777a12a3cc6f75, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Left click on resource piles to scavenge scrap from them.
    - To use resources, left click on the resource menu in the top-right, click on
